cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this white paper, please cite it as below."
title: "Enterprise Agent Hosting Platform: A Reference Architecture"
abstract: >-
  A reference architecture for hosting AI agents inside an enterprise. The
  enterprise owns the control plane (identity, authorization, the ledger, task
  state and interface contracts), rents runtimes, sandboxes and storage by
  usage, and binds to a minimal protocol rather than to any agent framework.
  Published in English and Simplified Chinese.
